-- 1359: Blog post -- "Multi AI Agents Workflow for Content Creation: Giving Every Stage Its Own Specialist".
-- Focus: specialist agents per production stage (research/strategy/write/design/edit/publish),
-- handoff contracts, the reviewer agent, and where human review stays mandatory.
-- Funnels to WSQ Multi AI Agents Workflow for Content Creation (TGS-2023036153), SG-only.
-- Published live (status=1), BACK-DATED to 2025-06-14 per the admin's "date all the digital
-- marketing blogs in Apr to Aug 2025" (post 9 of 16, WSQ/CASL digital marketing batch).
--
